# Only the C# gameplay scripts are tracked in this repo - everything else
# (Unity's generated caches, imported/third-party art assets, build output)
# is excluded so the repo stays to source code only.

# Ignore everything at the root by default...
/*

# ...except the things we actually want to track.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/Assets/
/Assets/*
!/Assets/Scripts/
